      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Leto vagó de tierra en tierra, pidiendo ayuda.",
          "en": "Leto wandered from land to land, asking for help."
        },
        {
          "es": "Llamó a la puerta de cada lugar. Y cada lugar le dijo que no.",
          "en": "She knocked at the door of every place. And every place said no."
        },
        {
          "es": "Las tierras no eran crueles. Tenían miedo de Hera, y miedo del poderoso hijo que Leto iba a tener.",
          "en": "The lands were not cruel. They were afraid of Hera, and afraid of the mighty son Leto would have."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pasaron los días. Leto estaba lejos de casa, y ya no tenía adónde ir.",
          "en": "Days passed. Leto was far from home, and she had nowhere left to go."
        }
      ],
