      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Leto pisó Delos. Y allí empezaron los dolores.",
          "en": "Leto stepped onto Delos. And there, her pains began."
        },
        {
          "es": "Llegaron diosas amables a acompañarla, como Rea, la madre de Zeus.",
          "en": "Kind goddesses came to stay with her, like Rhea, the mother of Zeus."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero durante nueve días y nueve noches, los bebés no nacían.",
          "en": "But for nine days and nine nights, the babies would not come."
        },
        {
          "es": "Algo faltaba. Ilitía, la diosa que ayuda en cada parto, no estaba allí.",
          "en": "Something was missing. Eileithyia, the goddess who helps every birth, was not there."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hera la tenía en el Olimpo, escondida bajo nubes doradas, para que no se enterara de nada.",
          "en": "Hera kept her on Olympus, hidden under golden clouds, so she would not hear a thing."
        }
      ],
