      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "En cuanto Ilitía pisó Delos, nació el primer bebé. Era una niña: Artemisa.",
          "en": "The moment Eileithyia set foot on Delos, the first baby was born. It was a girl: Artemis."
        },
        {
          "es": "Sería la diosa de la caza y de los animales salvajes.",
          "en": "She would become the goddess of the hunt and of wild animals."
        },
        {
          "es": "Un relato antiguo, contado por Apolodoro, dice algo asombroso sobre ella.",
          "en": "One old tale, told by Apollodorus, says something amazing about her."
        },
        {
          "es": "Apenas nació, la pequeña Artemisa ayudó a su madre a traer al mundo a su hermano gemelo.",
          "en": "Right after she was born, little Artemis helped her mother bring her twin brother into the world."
        },
        {
          "es": "Más tarde, las mujeres griegas que iban a tener un bebé le rezaban a Artemisa pidiendo ayuda.",
          "en": "Later, Greek women who were about to have a baby prayed to Artemis for help."
        }
